TI powered input clamp, INPUT1_1p8, additional resistance 33 ohm
* Nominal 1.8V model only. Optional 10k pullup represents CS or RESET.
* Bare case represents SCLK/SDI, which have no external pullup on this PCB.
* INPUT2 is RESET. Extra resistance is not a proposed level translator.
